OL,3,ACovid vaccine compensation scheme set
OL,4,Afor overhaul after Inquiry criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has committed to reform
OL,7,Fof the scheme that provides financial
OL,8,Fsupport for those injured or bereaved
OL,9,Fby vaccines.
OL,11,FIt was a key recommendation of the UK
OL,12,FCovid Inquiry, and has been a focus for
OL,13,Fcampaigners.
OL,15,FOne campaign group has welcomed the
OL,16,Frecognition that vaccine injury and
OL,17,Fbereavement is real and that the
OL,18,Fcurrent scheme is not fit for purpose.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
