OL,3,ACovid vaccine compensation scheme set
OL,4,Afor overhaul after Inquiry criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut it says it wants a clear commitment
OL,7,Fto action by ministers, rather than
OL,8,Fsimply saying they will look further at
OL,9,Fwhat needs to be done.
